@startuml SEQ2 — Search & Book
title SmartStays — Sequence Diagram (Part 2: Search & Book a Room)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A6FA5

actor User
participant "React App" as React
participant "Spring Boot API\n:4040" as API
database "MySQL DB" as DB

== Availability Search ==

User -> React : Enter check-in, check-out, room type
React -> API : GET /rooms/available-rooms-by-date-and-type\n?checkInDate=&checkOutDate=&roomType=
API -> DB : SELECT rooms WHERE no overlapping\nbookings exist for given date range
DB --> API : Available rooms list
API --> React : 200 OK [Room[]]
React --> User : Update room list display

== View Room Details ==

User -> React : Click room card → /rooms/{id}
React -> API : GET /rooms/{id}
API -> DB : SELECT room WHERE id = ?\n(with amenities, meal plans)
DB --> API : Room object
API --> React : 200 OK Room
React --> User : Show date picker, meal plan selector,\nBook Now button

== Navigate to Payment ==

User -> React : Click Book Now
React -> React : Check localStorage for JWT token

alt Not logged in
  React --> User : Redirect to /login
else Logged in
  React --> User : Navigate to /payment\n(booking data in router state)
end

@enduml
